# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal Engine 5 project .gitignore (match-3 architecture course)
# Patterns use **/ so they work whether the .uproject sits at the
# repo root or in a subfolder.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Generated by Unreal (rebuilt on every machine) ---
**/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Build/

# Baked lighting data (rebuilt from the map)
*_BuiltData.uasset

# --- IDE / generated project files ---
# Regenerate with right-click .uproject > Generate Visual Studio project files
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
.vs/
.vsconfig
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# --- Compiled output ---
*.obj
*.o
*.pdb
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.ilk
*.exe
*.so
*.dylib
*.pch
*.gch

# --- OS clutter ---
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
